{"Accessing `integration.metadata[\"sender\"][\"login\"]` on line 503 raises KeyError when the Integration was created without a \"sender\" key, since build_integration only adds \"sender\" conditionally, causing crashes for existing integrations or those created through code paths without \"sender\" in state.": 0.908963143825531, "The test `test_installation_not_found` passes for the wrong reason - it uses state=\"ddd023d87a913d5226e2a882c4c4cc05\" which mismatches the OAuth flow's established state, so the assertion passes due to state validation failure rather than the 404 on the installation endpoint. The correct state value should be used to actually test installation-not-found behavior.": 0.9135167002677917}